extraction_notes: |
  - Rifts World Book 6: South America printed 57-58 (cache p058-p059), read
    from the text layer and rendered at both pages to check every number.
    The brief named printed 57-59; the class ends on 58, where Biomancy
    Trees & Items begins, so the source_book says 57-58.
  - No class with id jungle-elf existed in production (checked --remote).
  - men_of_arms false: a race; the page prints no S.D.C. or hit point
